<article class="blog-container">

<!-- Featured Image -->
<div class="blog-featured-image">
  <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lukymania/wildrootshemp/main/wildroots-site/assets/images/blog-lucy-rollon-cartoon.jpg" alt="Illustration of a woman relaxing on the sofa while applying a roll-on to the back of her neck" loading="eager">
  <p class="blog-featured-caption">Applying a targeted roll-on to the neck and temples can help ease tension headache pain through the science of myofascial release and targeted absorption.</p>
